  "id": "fiboa/data",
  "title": "Field boundaries for Austria (2025)",
  "description": "A combined repository of agricultural field boundary datasets conforming to the fiboa 0.3.0+ specification, covering approximately 65 million georeferenced field polygons across 25+ countries in Europe, South America, North America, and beyond. Each national or regional asset includes field polygon geometries with harmonized crop type codes (HCAT), crop names, and area metrics derived from LPIS and other official agricultural cadastral systems. Coverage spans Austria, Belgium, Brazil, Bulgaria, Switzerland, Czech Republic, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Croatia, Ireland, Lithuania, Latvia, the Netherlands, Portugal, Romania, Sweden, Slovenia, Slovakia, the UK, and the US.",
